ted and will be removed in v0.14.0. Assign the `x` variable to `hue` and set `legend=False` for the same effect.\n","\n","  sns.countplot(x=\"sentiment\", data=df_train, palette=\"viridis\")\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 800x600 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"vCy-ZrzrmXCZ"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Grafica Evolución de la Loss y Accuracy durante el Entrenamiento\n","Si guardaste métricas por epoch (o simulas algunos valores), esta celda traza la pérdida y la accuracy en función del número de epoch:"],"metadata":{"id":"-RYkj5i0mii-"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","\n","# Ejemplo: Listas simuladas de métricas por epoch (reemplaza con tus valores reales)\n","epochs = list(range(1, 11))\n","loss_values = [0.5, 0.48, 0.45, 0.43, 0.4, 0.38, 0.36, 0.34, 0.33, 0.31]\n","accuracy_values = [0.70, 0.72, 0.74, 0.76, 0.78, 0.80, 0.82, 0.83, 0.84, 0.85]\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(12,5))\n","\n","plt.subplot(1,2,1)\n","plt.plot(epochs, loss_values, marker=\"o\", color=\"red\")\n","plt.title(\"Evolución de la Loss\")\n","plt.xlabel(\"Epoch\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Loss\")\n","\n","plt.subplot(1,2,2)\n","plt.plot(epochs, accuracy_values, marker=\"o\", color=\"green\")\n","plt.title(\"Evolución de la Accuracy\")\n","plt.xlabel(\"Epoch\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Accuracy\")\n","\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":407},"id":"lYi_dG6YgG9c","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1740443253848,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":790,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"0f9bd0e8-7b2d-419b-dec0-95fb6828ca64"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1200x500 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["#Grafica de  Matriz de Confusión\n","Si tienes las etiquetas reales y las predicciones de tu modelo, esta celda genera una matriz de confusión para visualizar el desempeño en cada clase:"],"metadata":{"id":"ObNe-jWcnDsJ"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import seaborn as sns\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","from sklearn.metrics import confusion_matrix\n","\n","# Ejemplo: Etiquetas verdaderas y predichas (reemplaza con tus datos reales)\n","true_labels = [0, 1, 0, 2, 1, 0, 2, 1, 2, 0]\n","pred_labels = [0, 1, 1, 2, 1, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0]\n","\n","# Calcular la matriz de confusión\n","cm = confusion_matrix(true_labels, pred_labels)\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(6,5))\n","sns.heatmap(cm, annot=True, fmt=\"d\", cmap=\"Blues\",\n","            xticklabels=list(label_map.values()),\n","            yticklabels=list(label_map.values()))\n","plt.xlabel(\"Etiquetas Predichas\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Etiquetas Reales\")\n","plt.title(\"Matriz de Confusión\")\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":487},"id":"xO6LT8OmgNXz","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1740443282265,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":1308,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"b19d73ef-69e0-4bad-ac03-eaef2bb0798a"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 600x500 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# GRAFICA DE DISPERCIÓN\n","##se visualizan la precisión (precision) en el eje X, el recall en el eje Y y el F1-score determina el tamaño de cada punto. Además, se etiquetan los puntos con el nombre de cada modelo para facilitar la interpretación."],"metadata":{"id":"t61UQwEfriJp"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","# Ejemplo: métricas obtenidas para tres modelos (reemplaza estos datos con tus valores reales)\n","models = [\"Modelo A\", \"Modelo B\", \"Modelo C\"]\n","precision = [0.85, 0.80, 0.90]\n","recall = [0.80, 0.75, 0.88]\n","f1_scores = [0.82, 0.77, 0.89]\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(8,6))\n","# Usamos el F1-score para definir el tamaño de cada punto (multiplicamos para hacerlo visualmente significativo)\n","sizes = [f1 * 1000 for f1 in f1_scores]\n","scatter = plt.scatter(precision, recall, s=sizes, c=f1_scores, cmap=\"viridis\", alpha=0.7)\n","\n","plt.xlabel(\"Precision\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Recall\")\n","plt.title(\"Gráfico de Dispersión: Precision vs Recall (F1-score como tamaño)\")\n","\n","# Agregar etiquetas para cada modelo\n","for i, model in enumerate(models):\n","    plt.text(precision[i] + 0.005, recall[i] + 0.005, model, fontsize=10)\n","\n","# Barra de color para el F1-score\n","cbar = plt.colorbar(scatter)\n","cbar.set_label(\"F1-score\")\n","\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":565},"id":"aMV349dmrAoR","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1740446318155,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":1089,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"cf8e181e-e978-4b4a-fd8d-350eb7fd5d94"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 800x600 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Si necesitas escribir tu ciclo de entrenamiento en PyTorch aqui esta en enlace de otra notebook adaptalo a la necesidades del proyecto:\n","https://goo.su/TYmOTs"],"metadata":{"id":"CNu1VJOC4E2R"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"EGjjqYSbsbyr"},"source":["##Para obtener más ejemplos de ajustes, consulte:\n","\n","- [🤗 Ejemplos de Transformers](https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/main/examples) incluye scripts\n","para entrenar tareas comunes de NLP en PyTorch y TensorFlow.\n","\n","- [🤗 Cuadernos de Transformers](https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/notebooks) contiene varios cuadernos